@* Capture UI: the sources panel on the Inbox pane.

   Every Backlog.* import is written as @@using global::Backlog.Something, for
   the reason Roadmap.UI's imports give: this project's root namespace is
   Backlog.Modules.Capture.UI, the Razor generator emits these directives inside
   that namespace without a global:: prefix, and a bare "Backlog" binds to
   Backlog.Modules the moment the reference closure declares one of that shape —
   which Backlog.Modules.Capture.Abstractions is. *@
@using global::Backlog.Modules.Capture.Abstractions
@using global::Backlog.Modules.Capture.Abstractions.DataTransferObjects
@using global::Backlog.Modules.Capture.Abstractions.Services
@using global::Backlog.UI.Components.Buttons
@using global::Backlog.UI.Components.Inputs
@using global::Backlog.UI.Components.Layout
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using System.Globalization
